  lines:
  - time: 0
    text: '[Phone Ringing]'
  - time: 10.6
    text: Hello? Hello, hello?
  - time: 12.8
    text: I was told to record a message for you, for your first day at the office.
  - time: 16.6
    text: I used to work in this exact cubicle, you know, before I was caught, uh,
      lacking.
  - time: 21.6
    text: 'But yeah, I''m supposed to help introduce you to the company, get you
      through your first week. '
  - time: 21.6
    text: 'But yeah, I''m supposed to help introduce you to the company, get you
      through your first week. '
  - time: 21.6
    text: Just do your work, Nothing too much to worry about.
  - time: 30.7
    text: "Uh, let\u2019s see, first there\u2019s an introductory greeting from the
      company, which I\u2019m supposed to read."
  - time: 30.7
    text: "Uh, it\u2019s kind of a legal thing, you know."
